              "props": {
                "html": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Hi {{first_name}}, it’s easy to focus on a listing price. A confident plan also considers what homeownership may cost month to month and at closing.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold\">Have you set a monthly range that feels comfortable?</p>",
